Author: Packaging Build Agent <packaging-agent@example.invalid>
Forwarded: no
Last-Update: 2026-09-21

Python 3.14 unittest.mock resolves each dotted component with getattr. Taskflow
keeps taskflow.utils.__init__ empty, so the test decorators cannot resolve the
kazoo_utils child until it has been imported. The production driver retains
its lazy import; the unit tests import the optional module and patch its
members directly.

